OL,3,CMan who died after alleged assault in
OL,4,CTurkey was 'devoted' father
OL,6,FA man who died after an alleged
OL,7,Fassault in Turkey was a "devoted"
OL,8,Ffather who "touched countless lives",
OL,9,Fhis family said.
OL,11,FScot James, 34, from Maesteg, South
OL,12,FWales, died in hospital on Sunday
OL,13,Fafter the incident earlier in July.
OL,15,FTurkish authorities are investigating
OL,16,Fthe alleged assault with support from
OL,17,Fthe Foreign, Commonwealth and
OL,18,FDevelopment Office (FCDO).
OL,26,@oD@YOUoD@aO]pD@LOUpD@dO]
