OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785608302
OL,3,CMan who died after alleged assault in
OL,4,CTurkey was 'devoted' father
OL,6,FMr James was flown back to Wales via
OL,7,Fair ambulance from Turkey on Friday
OL,8,FJuly 24 and died at the Royal
OL,9,FGlamorgan Hospital two days later.
OL,11,FIn a tribute issued by South Wales
OL,12,FPolice, Mr James' family said he was
OL,13,F"deeply loved by everyone who knew
OL,14,Fhim".
OL,16,FThey said: "He was a devoted son,
OL,17,Fgrandson, brother, partner, father,
OL,18,Funcle and friend, whose kindness and
OL,19,Floyalty touched countless lives.
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@DO]xD@LOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
