OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785608302
OL,3,CMan who died after alleged assault in
OL,4,CTurkey was 'devoted' father
OL,6,F"He had a warm heart, a great sense of
OL,7,Fhumour, and a natural ability to bring
OL,8,Fpeople together, leaving a lasting
OL,9,Fimpression on all who had the
OL,10,Fprivilege of knowing him.
OL,12,F"As a family, we are heartbroken by
OL,13,Fhis loss. No words can truly express
OL,14,Fthe pain we are experiencing or the
OL,15,Fvoid his passing has left in our lives.
OL,17,F"We will treasure the time we shared
OL,18,Fwith him and hold him close in our
OL,19,Fhearts always.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
