OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785608302
OL,3,CMan who died after alleged assault in
OL,4,CTurkey was 'devoted' father
OL,6,F"Although Scot's life was taken far
OL,7,Ftoo soon, the love he gave, and the
OL,8,Fimpact he had on those around him,
OL,9,Fwill never be forgotten.
OL,11,F"We would like to thank everyone for
OL,12,Fthe overwhelming support, kindness and
OL,13,Fcompassion shown to our family during
OL,14,Fthis incredibly difficult time.
OL,16,F"We also extend our sincere thanks to
OL,17,Fall those who have cared for Scot and
OL,18,Fsupported us throughout this ordeal.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU
