OL,3,CMan who died after alleged assault in
OL,4,CTurkey was 'devoted' father
OL,6,F"We respectfully ask that our family's
OL,7,Fprivacy is honoured as we grieve
OL,8,Ftogether and begin to come to terms
OL,9,Fwith this devastating loss."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@\O]
